      "message": "fix(ui): the budget Set and the tool list Edit are in reach at 1280 x 720\n\nThe STEP facet budget label takes its own line, so Set stands inside the\nProperties pane. The setup tool table gets a gutter for its floating\nscroll bar, so a centre click on Edit after a scroll across reaches the\nbutton. Delete operation is pinned inside the pane.\n\nPinned by layout_page_model, layout_page_operation and\na_centre_click_on_edit_opens_the_tool_after_a_scroll_across.\n\nFixes #1992\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
